    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AWX LAB episode builder\nFor episodes you record yourself in **AWX Studio** (Silent mode).\n\n1. Record in Studio, save the session folder into your `_projects` folder.\n2. Run this workflow: it cuts the recording (cuts, retakes dropped, time-lapses, callouts), has the AI turn your script into **spoken** narration, records it in your Voicebox voice (Whisper-checked), holds the last frame of a step when the narration is longer than the footage, adds title/end card, captions, chapters and music.\n3. You approve a preview sheet before the long render.\n\nNeeds `pipeline/server.py` running (see n8n/README.md). Edit **Config** first.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
